WEBVTT

00:38.200 --> 00:39.280
Zhou Rong is not playing tricks.

00:39.280 --> 00:40.040
How so?

00:40.600 --> 00:43.090
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

00:43.970 --> 00:45.270
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

00:46.850 --> 00:49.390
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

00:47.240 --> 00:48.360
20 million.

00:48.790 --> 00:50.320
They can't get that much
from the bank this early.

00:50.130 --> 00:51.580
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

00:50.990 --> 00:52.720
They can only find people
to scrape it together.

00:52.720 --> 00:53.610
♪ Oh, gimme ♪

00:52.840 --> 00:54.670
These people are all here
to deliver money.

00:54.670 --> 00:56.650
♪ Dance me in the richness ♪

00:57.810 --> 00:59.400
♪ Raining, make it rain ♪

00:59.870 --> 01:02.510
♪ Oh, cash is my revolution ♪

02:33.400 --> 02:36.970
[Born with Luck]

02:37.070 --> 02:40.010
[Episode 22]

02:40.130 --> 02:44.710
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital]

02:50.079 --> 02:51.280
You stay here and keep watch.

02:51.280 --> 02:52.810
Don't let anyone get close.

02:52.870 --> 02:53.400
Yes, sir.

02:55.710 --> 02:56.280
Who is it?

02:56.280 --> 02:57.540
Wh-What are you doing?

03:02.430 --> 03:04.090
I didn't do anything illegal.

03:06.040 --> 03:06.770
Chief Zhang.

03:07.560 --> 03:08.870
I was fast asleep.

03:09.240 --> 03:11.100
My heart is racing from the shock.

03:12.750 --> 03:14.480
What's going on, Captain Wang?

03:15.310 --> 03:16.630
You...

03:17.079 --> 03:17.750
Me?

03:21.030 --> 03:22.150
Yes, you.

03:22.190 --> 03:22.710
Me?

03:31.970 --> 03:33.500
We found a set of bianzhong.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.980
Does it have anything to do with you?

03:37.900 --> 03:38.579
No.

03:42.310 --> 03:42.960
Really.

03:49.000 --> 03:51.260
I'm not interested in that kind of stuff.

03:53.750 --> 03:54.950
Really, Chief Zhang.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.730
I'm not into that kind of thing.

03:57.310 --> 03:58.570
Really, Captain Wang.

04:01.150 --> 04:01.840
"Zhong"—the end—

04:01.840 --> 04:03.500
signifies bad luck after all.

04:08.080 --> 04:08.810
Makes sense.

04:09.120 --> 04:09.920
Get some rest.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.790
Watch what you're doing.

04:21.620 --> 04:22.430
Chief Zhang!

04:23.120 --> 04:24.720
You can't treat me like this!

04:33.540 --> 04:34.790
Am I dreaming?

04:41.210 --> 04:44.610
[First Inpatient Department]

04:49.680 --> 04:50.920
Turn off all the headlights.

04:50.920 --> 04:51.390
Be quiet.

04:51.390 --> 04:53.210
Don't disturb the people resting.

04:53.210 --> 04:54.230
Get in the car.

04:57.960 --> 05:01.560
[First Inpatient Department]

05:03.830 --> 05:04.560
Chief Zhang.

05:04.920 --> 05:06.050
What are we here for?

05:07.270 --> 05:08.400
What are we here for?

05:10.430 --> 05:12.190
To make Zhou Rong suspect Lang Bowen.

05:12.190 --> 05:13.520
I thought so too before.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.220
But...

05:14.240 --> 05:15.680
Haven't we used this trick before?

05:15.680 --> 05:16.600
How many times have we used it?

05:16.600 --> 05:17.330
Three times.

05:17.750 --> 05:18.810
You think

05:19.000 --> 05:19.800
all is fair in war.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.830
Exactly because we've used it—

05:20.830 --> 05:21.950
and we used it 3 times—

05:21.950 --> 05:22.630
Zhou Rong is very likely

05:22.630 --> 05:23.830
to have anticipated what we anticipated.

05:23.830 --> 05:24.580
But he won't anticipate

05:24.580 --> 05:26.780
that we anticipated his anticipation.

05:27.690 --> 05:29.490
Zhou Rong is about to make a move?

05:38.340 --> 05:43.590
[Police]

05:52.310 --> 05:52.770
Rong...

05:54.640 --> 05:56.460
[Come on—What if it's funny?]

06:22.660 --> 06:25.370
[Health and longevity]

06:27.220 --> 06:27.750
Dad.

06:29.630 --> 06:30.120
Mom.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.650
I am unfilial.

06:35.800 --> 06:36.760
This parting...

06:41.800 --> 06:42.840
Old man.

06:43.070 --> 06:44.620
They say you raise a son
so they can

06:44.620 --> 06:46.350
take care of you in your old age.

06:46.430 --> 06:48.550
Have our son drive back

06:48.580 --> 06:51.260
and take you to see the doctor,
okay?

06:53.000 --> 06:53.870
No need.

06:54.840 --> 06:56.510
He works in a big company.

06:56.870 --> 06:58.110
He's very busy.

06:59.120 --> 06:59.720
Let's...

07:00.390 --> 07:02.640
Let's not cause him trouble.

07:07.700 --> 07:10.190
This is a million US dollars...

07:30.830 --> 07:31.390
Dad.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.140
I'm back.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.580
You're coughing so badly.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.480
Why don't you go to the hospital?

07:38.070 --> 07:39.870
I'll go buy you some cough syrup.

07:52.220 --> 07:53.970
[Lower your head]

08:04.740 --> 08:10.990
[Lower your head]

08:18.410 --> 08:22.750
[Lower your head]

08:27.830 --> 08:28.270
Hello?

08:30.070 --> 08:30.680
Ren?

08:36.789 --> 08:37.850
The money's ready?

08:38.080 --> 08:39.000
The money is in the car.

08:39.000 --> 08:39.929
You can count it.

08:39.950 --> 08:40.480
Let's go.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.870
Mr. Zhou, take your medicine first.

08:42.870 --> 08:43.200
Here.

08:49.310 --> 08:50.600
There's one more thing.

08:50.600 --> 08:51.000
What?

08:51.030 --> 08:52.270
Zhang Yi'ang went to the hospital

08:52.270 --> 08:53.870
to see Lang Bowen last night.

08:56.150 --> 08:57.320
What did they talk about?

08:57.320 --> 08:58.050
I'm not sure.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.120
I heard the hallway

08:59.120 --> 09:00.590
was guarded by the police.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.000
Only Zhang Yi'ang

09:02.030 --> 09:03.510
and Wang Ruijun went into the room.

09:03.510 --> 09:05.240
They left without saying much.

09:11.510 --> 09:12.390
Also, Du Cong

09:12.390 --> 09:13.480
just called.

09:13.910 --> 09:14.410
He said

09:14.440 --> 09:15.840
they found Li Penggai's car,

09:15.840 --> 09:17.040
and the money is in it.

09:19.630 --> 09:20.080
Okay.

09:20.670 --> 09:21.870
Tell them all to come!

09:29.910 --> 09:31.240
It's Li Penggai, right?

09:32.030 --> 09:33.520
Gai, what happened?

09:34.270 --> 09:34.840
I'm fine.

09:35.390 --> 09:36.200
Open the small gate for me.

09:36.200 --> 09:36.750
Okay.

09:40.480 --> 09:40.910
Okay.

09:41.790 --> 09:42.480
Lock it up.

09:42.600 --> 09:42.930
Good.

09:44.390 --> 09:45.990
Li Penggai just went inside.

09:48.360 --> 09:50.020
This is going to be a good show.

10:08.470 --> 10:09.000
Mr. Zhou.

10:09.510 --> 10:09.960
Ren.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.200
They snatched

10:17.320 --> 10:17.920
the money?

10:19.550 --> 10:20.850
They stole the car too?

10:23.080 --> 10:24.080
According to you,

10:25.000 --> 10:27.400
those two junk collectors are just losers.

10:28.870 --> 10:30.070
You had a knife on you,

10:30.550 --> 10:31.720
yet you got knocked out

10:31.720 --> 10:33.580
and got your money and car stolen.

10:35.860 --> 10:38.060
Do you think anyone would believe that?

10:39.670 --> 10:40.690
Think I'm a fool,

10:40.720 --> 10:41.030
huh?

10:41.030 --> 10:41.860
No, no. I...

10:41.960 --> 10:42.790
I-I remember now.

10:42.790 --> 10:43.200
I remember.

10:43.200 --> 10:43.960
It wasn't them. It wasn't them.

10:43.960 --> 10:44.550
Then who was it?

10:44.550 --> 10:45.030
Well...

10:47.960 --> 10:49.030
When it happened,

10:50.750 --> 10:52.550
one of them was on this side of me,

10:52.670 --> 10:54.330
and the other was on this side.

10:54.840 --> 10:55.790
It wasn't them.

11:00.000 --> 11:01.150
There must be someone else.

11:01.150 --> 11:02.880
There has to be another person!

11:03.910 --> 11:04.670
So you're saying,

11:04.670 --> 11:05.750
with your skills,

11:05.910 --> 11:07.120
you didn't even notice

11:07.120 --> 11:07.750
that there was someone else

11:07.750 --> 11:08.950
in such a small space?

11:10.720 --> 11:11.580
He's an expert.

11:12.030 --> 11:12.960
Super fast too.

11:13.270 --> 11:14.440
I couldn't even react

11:14.440 --> 11:15.840
before I was knocked out.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.460
So they have the phone?

11:18.750 --> 11:19.720
P-Probably.

11:20.440 --> 11:21.270
It was when I asked them

11:21.270 --> 11:22.080
for the phone

11:22.390 --> 11:23.520
that I was ambushed.

11:27.080 --> 11:27.550
Ren.

11:32.510 --> 11:34.370
Can we trust what Li Penggai said?

11:37.240 --> 11:37.900
I trust him.

11:38.480 --> 11:38.910
Why?

11:43.270 --> 11:44.480
One million dollars.

11:45.630 --> 11:47.080
Because he knows what will happen to him

11:47.080 --> 11:48.340
if he takes your money.

11:57.420 --> 11:58.880
I took my medicine, right?

11:59.510 --> 11:59.870
Okay.

12:00.630 --> 12:01.600
Those two junk collectors

12:01.600 --> 12:02.680
took my phone.

12:02.960 --> 12:03.630
Then those two who robbed me—

12:03.630 --> 12:05.360
why do they still want to
make a deal with me?

12:05.360 --> 12:06.620
They want to kidnap me?

12:08.240 --> 12:09.360
Besides, who could knock him out

12:09.360 --> 12:10.560
with just one strike?

12:10.790 --> 12:11.750
Who is his boss,

12:12.080 --> 12:13.280
and what do they want?

12:19.670 --> 12:20.120
Hello?

12:20.490 --> 12:21.540
Hello, Mr. Zhou.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.450
I thought about it.

12:23.790 --> 12:25.320
Twenty million is too much.

12:25.600 --> 12:26.390
It's appropriate for us,

12:26.390 --> 12:27.270
but not for you.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.220
How about this?

12:29.440 --> 12:30.240
Five million.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.150
10 o'clock.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.550
Five million.

12:34.270 --> 12:35.360
Put it in the trash can

12:35.360 --> 12:36.440
at Sculpture Square.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.100
How's that?

12:38.440 --> 12:38.960
Sure.

12:40.270 --> 12:41.870
Make sure you come and get it.

12:45.150 --> 12:45.670
Rong.

12:46.360 --> 12:47.750
Those two boys are showing mercy.

12:47.750 --> 12:48.790
They said 20 million is too much,

12:48.790 --> 12:50.320
and lowered it to 5 million.

12:50.550 --> 12:51.200
Put it in the trash can

12:51.200 --> 12:52.150
at Sculpture Square

12:52.150 --> 12:52.950
at 10 o'clock.

12:55.000 --> 12:55.530
Mr. Zhou,

12:56.090 --> 12:57.440
this doesn't feel right.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.700
Let's cancel the deal.

12:58.790 --> 12:59.790
Cancel what?

13:00.000 --> 13:01.150
Since they want to play,

13:01.150 --> 13:02.810
I'll play a big game with them.

13:12.410 --> 13:12.880
Drive.

13:19.090 --> 13:22.580
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital]

13:24.150 --> 13:25.450
What time's lunch?

13:25.840 --> 13:26.460
Bowen,

13:26.600 --> 13:27.600
it's still early.

13:28.550 --> 13:29.700
Go order some fruit.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.840
What are you mulling over now?

13:39.080 --> 13:40.480
Let me sort it out for you.

13:41.240 --> 13:41.670
Bro,

13:42.030 --> 13:43.630
how can you still eat?

13:44.840 --> 13:46.030
If Mr. Zhou doesn't contact us,

13:46.030 --> 13:47.170
can't we just ask him

13:47.200 --> 13:48.910
if he found the phone or not?

13:50.030 --> 13:51.830
Why do I feel like
you are my boss?

13:52.870 --> 13:53.790
Boss, here.

13:54.160 --> 13:55.220
Have some nuts.

13:58.270 --> 14:00.070
Do you think the fruit is for you?

14:00.390 --> 14:01.920
Zhou Rong will be here soon.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.770
Bowen, Mr. Zhou is here.

14:05.790 --> 14:06.390
Let him in.

14:07.200 --> 14:07.730
Mr. Zhou.

14:10.240 --> 14:10.820
Mr. Zhou.

14:11.030 --> 14:11.560
Mr. Zhou.

14:12.000 --> 14:12.530
Jianren.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.240
Ren.

14:13.670 --> 14:14.030
Sit.

14:14.360 --> 14:15.070
Well,

14:15.200 --> 14:16.480
I had someone order some fruit.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.600
What do you want to eat?

14:17.600 --> 14:18.640
What's all this?

14:18.720 --> 14:19.510
I came to see you.

14:19.510 --> 14:20.390
Of course I should be the one
buying things.

14:20.390 --> 14:22.030
How could I let you buy anything?

14:22.030 --> 14:23.290
I brought everything.

14:28.080 --> 14:29.610
Jianren, give me a back rub.

14:31.270 --> 14:32.110
Pound my back!

14:35.840 --> 14:36.440
Yangyang.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.630
You go out first.

14:37.630 --> 14:39.830
Mr. Zhou and I have business to discuss.

14:40.600 --> 14:41.930
Don't leave, Yangyang.

14:42.550 --> 14:43.430
You are not a kid anymore.

14:43.430 --> 14:45.560
You should care about family matters.

14:45.870 --> 14:46.640
Sit down.

14:54.120 --> 14:54.670
Mr. Zhou.

14:55.850 --> 14:57.090
You seem quite angry.

15:03.070 --> 15:04.240
Is it because of

15:04.270 --> 15:06.130
Zhang Yi'ang's visit last night?

15:07.320 --> 15:08.450
Can you explain that

15:08.790 --> 15:10.550
clearly to me?

15:11.670 --> 15:13.480
If I could explain this clearly,

15:13.960 --> 15:16.420
then Zhang Yi'ang
would be too incompetent.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.390
If I told you

15:23.550 --> 15:24.200
he came here last night

15:24.200 --> 15:25.200
making a big scene

15:25.670 --> 15:26.800
but told me nothing—

15:27.440 --> 15:29.150
just wants you to make me doubt you

15:29.150 --> 15:30.720
and cause internal friction—

15:30.720 --> 15:32.050
would you believe that?

15:45.150 --> 15:45.680
Mr. Zhou,

15:46.360 --> 15:47.290
what will it take

15:48.070 --> 15:50.250
for you to believe me?

15:53.640 --> 15:54.810
In 1944,

15:55.670 --> 15:57.400
on the Western Front in Europe,

15:58.480 --> 16:00.940
20 German divisions besieged the Ardennes.

16:01.440 --> 16:03.470
8,000 American soldiers surrendered.

16:03.470 --> 16:04.750
But the 101st Airborne Division

16:04.750 --> 16:05.810
held the line.

16:06.910 --> 16:07.720
In the end,

16:08.110 --> 16:09.640
the Allies won the victory.

16:10.080 --> 16:11.440
Now I am Eisenhower.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.120
Are you willing

16:13.550 --> 16:15.410
to be my 101st Airborne Division?

16:22.160 --> 16:25.160
You know about the battle
of the back mountain, right?

16:25.870 --> 16:27.070
Whose back mountain?

16:28.720 --> 16:30.360
Those 2 guys who snatched the phone

16:30.360 --> 16:31.360
are now asking for 5 million

16:31.360 --> 16:32.110
to redeem the phone.

16:32.110 --> 16:33.790
They asked me to drop
the money at 10 o'clock today...

16:33.790 --> 16:34.630
Sculpture Square.

16:34.630 --> 16:36.000
In the trash can at Sculpture Square.

16:36.000 --> 16:38.080
They will return the phone
when they see the money.

16:38.080 --> 16:39.080
Coincidentally,

16:39.360 --> 16:40.630
Zhu Yifei asked me

16:40.670 --> 16:42.330
to trade the bianzhong today.

16:44.120 --> 16:44.920
So I was hoping

16:45.360 --> 16:46.200
you could help me run

16:46.200 --> 16:47.720
the phone deal errand.

16:48.530 --> 16:49.790
I have the money ready.

17:15.480 --> 17:17.270
As for those two,

17:17.680 --> 17:18.880
do whatever you want.

17:18.880 --> 17:19.760
But the phone,

17:19.920 --> 17:21.050
you must get it back.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.310
If my leg were fine,

17:24.349 --> 17:25.710
I would definitely go.

17:26.160 --> 17:26.960
That's why I had Yangyang

17:26.960 --> 17:27.819
stay, didn't I?

17:32.030 --> 17:32.590
Mr. Zhou.

17:33.350 --> 17:34.480
I can go in his stead.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.240
Shut up.

17:36.750 --> 17:37.870
What?

17:38.110 --> 17:39.550
I can't go, and you can't go—

17:39.550 --> 17:40.640
can't Yangyang go?

17:41.480 --> 17:43.140
Don't want the phone anymore?

17:44.790 --> 17:45.680
Bowen.

17:46.720 --> 17:47.960
You don't care

17:48.880 --> 17:50.440
about this phone at all?

17:51.510 --> 17:53.510
I do care. I care a lot.

17:54.070 --> 17:55.640
But we can't let Yangyang go.

17:55.640 --> 17:56.780
Then who else can go?

17:57.310 --> 17:57.960
Who?

17:58.200 --> 17:59.030
Who else?

18:00.600 --> 18:02.070
I can just give up this phone.

18:02.070 --> 18:02.830
At worst, I'll move somewhere else

18:02.830 --> 18:04.230
and still make a fortune.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.240
But I won't.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.000
I want those bastards to know

18:07.000 --> 18:08.440
that no one can touch my money.

18:08.440 --> 18:09.440
Whoever lays a finger on it,

18:09.440 --> 18:11.040
I'll fight them to the death.

18:11.310 --> 18:12.880
That's my principle.

18:13.440 --> 18:14.310
Look at you.

18:14.350 --> 18:15.550
What have you become?

18:16.440 --> 18:18.000
Are you still the dominating

18:18.000 --> 18:18.750
Bowen?

18:19.790 --> 18:21.080
It's obvious

18:21.110 --> 18:23.030
that someone is targeting us.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.960
Why are you too scared to step up?

18:25.480 --> 18:27.240
Hiding is useless.

18:27.440 --> 18:28.400
If you're done for

18:28.400 --> 18:29.330
and I'm done for,

18:29.400 --> 18:30.660
will Yangyang be fine?

18:34.070 --> 18:35.920
You have quite a few enemies, right?

18:35.920 --> 18:36.590
Without protection,

18:36.590 --> 18:38.250
what will happen to Yangyang?

18:40.510 --> 18:41.270
Bowen,

18:41.680 --> 18:42.550
I think

18:43.000 --> 18:45.000
you should let Yangyang take a chance.

18:45.000 --> 18:46.310
Give him an opportunity

18:46.310 --> 18:47.580
to surprise us all.

18:47.790 --> 18:48.450
How's that?

18:55.510 --> 18:56.020
Bro,

18:57.130 --> 18:58.130
let me go.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.240
Get ready to work.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.080
Yangyang,

19:07.400 --> 19:09.060
I'll wait for you downstairs.

19:25.690 --> 19:26.740
Remember this,

19:27.350 --> 19:28.590
leave no survivors.

19:29.310 --> 19:29.720
Okay.

19:31.830 --> 19:32.690
What about you?

19:33.160 --> 19:33.720
Why?

19:34.510 --> 19:35.370
Do you think another team will pop up

19:35.370 --> 19:36.830
and attack me from behind?

19:41.440 --> 19:42.410
Come here.

19:50.640 --> 19:51.500
Are you stupid?

19:51.750 --> 19:52.510
Huh?

19:54.680 --> 19:55.550
I know

19:55.590 --> 19:56.720
you want to drive Zhou Rong away.

19:56.720 --> 19:58.020
But now is not the time.

19:58.070 --> 19:59.070
That phone is

19:59.110 --> 20:00.070
more important to you than
it is to Zhou Rong.

20:00.070 --> 20:01.200
You don't know shit!

20:02.350 --> 20:03.110
Not to mention the phone

20:03.110 --> 20:04.000
falling into the hands of the police,

20:04.000 --> 20:05.000
even if it's on the national news,

20:05.000 --> 20:06.200
I wouldn't be afraid.

20:09.070 --> 20:09.750
Why?

20:11.730 --> 20:13.710
Because I didn't kill Lu Zheng.

20:14.070 --> 20:15.680
He was hit by a car.

20:18.030 --> 20:19.660
When I was following him,

20:19.960 --> 20:20.830
the phone happened to record

20:20.830 --> 20:21.830
the moment he was hit—

20:21.830 --> 20:22.960
what a coincidence!

20:23.510 --> 20:24.920
I showed the video to Zhou Rong,

20:24.920 --> 20:25.680
saying I did

20:25.720 --> 20:26.400
exactly what he wanted

20:26.400 --> 20:27.860
just to get money from him.

20:32.030 --> 20:32.680
It had absolutely nothing

20:32.680 --> 20:34.240
to do with us in the first place.

20:34.240 --> 20:35.240
If Zhou Rong ran away in fear,

20:35.240 --> 20:36.770
Sanjiangkou would be ours.

20:37.310 --> 20:38.370
It's a great thing.

20:41.680 --> 20:43.680
Now he's forcing me to kill someone.

20:46.120 --> 20:48.180
He couldn't do anything to me before.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.030
But look at you—

20:49.030 --> 20:49.920
you agreed to it.

20:49.920 --> 20:50.850
What do we do now?

20:58.160 --> 20:58.640
Go

20:59.200 --> 21:00.530
a little further later.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.640
Find a payphone

21:01.680 --> 21:02.810
and call the police.

21:03.270 --> 21:05.640
Whatever you do,
don't tell them who you are.

21:05.640 --> 21:06.650
Tell the police

21:06.680 --> 21:07.790
about the phone deal.

21:07.790 --> 21:09.270
If the police catch those two first,

21:09.270 --> 21:10.230
we'll be fine.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.270
Do you hear me?

21:15.310 --> 21:16.170
I can't do that.

21:18.000 --> 21:18.830
Why?

21:30.550 --> 21:31.110
Here,

21:31.830 --> 21:32.430
take this.

21:34.470 --> 21:35.730
Zhu Yifei has a gun too.

21:36.240 --> 21:36.910
You keep it.

21:37.270 --> 21:37.930
I have a way.

21:43.070 --> 21:44.270
I'll take the stairs.

22:05.480 --> 22:06.560
In the future,

22:06.640 --> 22:08.480
don't make decisions on your own.

22:08.480 --> 22:09.210
Ask me first.

22:10.000 --> 22:11.280
The reason I'm your bro

22:11.310 --> 22:12.970
isn't just because I am older.

22:20.240 --> 22:21.040
Bowen.

22:21.200 --> 22:22.550
Why are you the one going?

22:22.550 --> 22:23.410
Are you up to it?

22:24.270 --> 22:25.350
What else can we do?

22:25.720 --> 22:27.270
I'm Number One after all.

22:28.510 --> 22:30.240
You really are a good brother.

22:32.400 --> 22:33.460
Give me your phone.

22:44.550 --> 22:45.240
Charge it.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.130
Use this one.

22:47.590 --> 22:48.850
They will contact you.

22:53.830 --> 22:54.430
Good luck.

22:55.110 --> 22:55.640
Okay.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.080
Lang Bowen is out.

23:01.110 --> 23:02.070
We'll follow him.

23:02.070 --> 23:03.600
You keep an eye on Zhou Rong.

23:04.510 --> 23:05.240
Understood.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.590
Hu Jianren drove away.

23:15.590 --> 23:16.510
We'll follow him.

23:16.510 --> 23:18.370
Team 2, cover the hospital for us.

23:31.790 --> 23:33.000
Will this trick work?

23:34.030 --> 23:34.760
Absolutely.

23:36.480 --> 23:38.350
Tomorrow, I'll say
I've been coughing up blood lately.

23:38.350 --> 23:39.810
I'll wear this vest inside

23:40.000 --> 23:41.930
and go to the hospital for an X-ray.

23:42.030 --> 23:44.070
Mr. Zhou will have to let me go
to the provincial capital

23:44.070 --> 23:45.030
or Beijing for treatment.

23:45.030 --> 23:46.090
Will he believe it?

23:48.000 --> 23:49.830
It'll be a huge black patch on the lungs—

23:49.830 --> 23:50.960
that's lung cancer.

23:51.550 --> 23:53.150
I'm going to get lung cancer.

24:00.680 --> 24:01.400
Ren?

24:02.240 --> 24:02.880
Ren?

24:03.550 --> 24:05.020
I heard at the door

24:05.400 --> 24:07.000
you're getting lung cancer.

24:08.240 --> 24:09.300
I was just kidding.

24:10.440 --> 24:11.240
Come in.

24:12.910 --> 24:13.430
Here.

24:13.550 --> 24:15.410
Ren, please have a seat.

24:15.590 --> 24:16.420
Sit.

24:48.440 --> 24:49.170
Turn around.

24:54.350 --> 24:56.060
This is where your heart is.

24:57.350 --> 24:58.680
This is a heart disease.

25:01.640 --> 25:03.110
Mr. Zhou has already started

25:03.110 --> 25:03.830
suspecting you.

25:03.830 --> 25:05.110
Can you stop asking for

25:05.110 --> 25:06.140
trouble?

25:06.590 --> 25:07.790
What should I do then?

25:08.400 --> 25:09.200
How can I make Mr. Zhou

25:09.200 --> 25:10.330
stop suspecting me?

25:10.590 --> 25:12.190
That's exactly why I'm here.

25:12.510 --> 25:13.440
Last night, Zhu Yifei

25:13.440 --> 25:14.560
called Mr. Zhou,

25:14.920 --> 25:16.750
saying they'll trade the bianzhong today

25:16.750 --> 25:19.410
and specifically asked Mr. Zhou
to go in person.

25:19.590 --> 25:20.070
So,

25:21.510 --> 25:23.510
Mr. Zhou is planning to take him out.

25:28.830 --> 25:31.230
It's too dangerous
for Mr. Zhou to go alone.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.200
How about

25:33.110 --> 25:34.310
you go instead of him?

25:35.310 --> 25:36.030
Ren,

25:36.640 --> 25:37.100
well...

25:37.720 --> 25:38.680
can he not go?

25:50.480 --> 25:51.240
Shall I talk to Mr. Zhou

25:51.240 --> 25:52.440
about this?

25:56.550 --> 25:57.010
I'll go.

25:58.160 --> 25:58.770
I'll go.

26:00.160 --> 26:00.720
Yibo.

26:01.350 --> 26:01.720
Yi...

26:03.780 --> 26:04.980
Change your clothes.

26:20.610 --> 26:22.120
What were you thinking?

26:28.030 --> 26:29.060
Go find Lang Bowen

26:29.350 --> 26:30.550
and ask him to help me.

26:31.270 --> 26:32.330
Just tell him

26:32.470 --> 26:33.510
I will definitely not tell anyone

26:33.510 --> 26:34.510
about what happened

26:34.510 --> 26:36.100
the night Ye Jian died.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.880
Ask him to please help me.

26:38.400 --> 26:39.130
Got it?

26:39.720 --> 26:41.180
You can only tell him this.

26:42.830 --> 26:43.350
Got it.

26:43.970 --> 26:44.730
[Meal Times]

26:44.160 --> 26:44.830
You just have to do the paperwork

26:44.830 --> 26:46.270
at the inpatient department.

26:46.270 --> 26:46.880
Thank you.

26:53.510 --> 26:54.110
Yangyang!

26:54.880 --> 26:55.480
Yangyang!

26:56.510 --> 26:58.170
Which room is your brother in?

27:02.240 --> 27:03.350
Where is your brother?

27:03.350 --> 27:04.060
Where is he?

27:05.480 --> 27:06.740
What's the matter, Qi?

27:07.960 --> 27:08.750
I am looking for him.

27:08.750 --> 27:10.080
His phone is turned off.

27:11.000 --> 27:12.480
My brother is not available right now.

27:12.480 --> 27:13.550
Where is he? Tell me.

27:13.550 --> 27:14.480
There's no time.

27:15.550 --> 27:16.510
My brother went out on an errand.

27:16.510 --> 27:17.240
If there's anything,

27:17.240 --> 27:18.300
you can tell me, Qi.

27:19.310 --> 27:20.590
Yibo is in trouble.

27:20.960 --> 27:22.290
Only Bowen can help him.

27:22.720 --> 27:24.850
When you see your brother, tell him...

27:26.720 --> 27:27.830
Yibo will never tell anyone

27:27.830 --> 27:28.680
what happened

27:29.790 --> 27:31.480
on the night Ye Jian died.

27:31.790 --> 27:33.450
Ask your brother to call Yibo.

27:34.960 --> 27:36.270
B-But my brother won't be back

27:36.270 --> 27:37.780
anytime soon.

27:46.070 --> 27:46.640
Zhang.

27:47.920 --> 27:49.160
Is putting all our attention

27:49.160 --> 27:50.240
on Zhou Rong

27:50.240 --> 27:51.200
and Lang Bowen

27:51.880 --> 27:52.550
a good idea?

27:53.350 --> 27:54.680
What's wrong with that?

27:57.350 --> 27:58.690
When Fang Chao and Liu Zhi

27:58.690 --> 28:00.150
were getting gas earlier,

28:00.160 --> 28:01.110
they tried to pay in US dollars

28:01.110 --> 28:02.110
but got rejected.

28:02.370 --> 28:03.700
Then they went to a hotel

28:03.880 --> 28:05.960
and paid the deposit in US dollars too.

28:05.960 --> 28:07.000
Could it be that they don't have

28:07.000 --> 28:08.660
any Chinese Yuan left on them?

28:09.590 --> 28:10.160
So?

28:10.880 --> 28:12.550
So they will definitely try

28:12.550 --> 28:13.550
to get some money.

28:13.640 --> 28:14.400
How?

28:16.750 --> 28:18.410
How will they try to get money?

28:25.640 --> 28:26.310
The phone.

28:27.350 --> 28:27.790
They still have

28:27.790 --> 28:28.880
that phone.

28:29.920 --> 28:30.830
They will definitely find Zhou Rong

28:30.830 --> 28:31.440
to strike a deal

28:31.440 --> 28:32.900
with this phone for money.

28:34.000 --> 28:34.750
So if we just

28:34.790 --> 28:36.070
keep a close eye on Zhou Rong's gang,

28:36.070 --> 28:37.330
we can catch these two.

28:38.720 --> 28:39.510
Our current plan

28:39.510 --> 28:40.270
is flawless.

28:40.880 --> 28:41.610
Chief Zhang.

28:44.160 --> 28:44.640
Speak.

28:45.590 --> 28:47.070
Just received an anonymous tip

28:47.070 --> 28:48.110
saying Zhou Rong has an

28:48.110 --> 28:49.370
important deal today.

28:51.030 --> 28:52.030
What kind of deal?

28:52.350 --> 28:53.110
They didn't say.

28:53.110 --> 28:54.170
But there's a deal.

28:57.830 --> 28:59.430
Zhou Rong is quite busy, huh?

28:59.960 --> 29:01.030
Keep a close eye on him.

29:01.030 --> 29:02.540
See what he's up to today.

29:04.960 --> 29:07.820
♪ The chance is waiting patiently
in the bowl ♪

29:08.810 --> 29:10.140
♪ Who covered my eyes ♪

29:10.880 --> 29:12.670
♪ I'm full of ideas ♪

29:26.550 --> 29:26.950
Hello?

29:27.480 --> 29:29.610
Put it in the trash can at the entrance.

29:30.000 --> 29:30.480
Put the case

29:30.480 --> 29:31.310
in those two trash cans.

29:31.310 --> 29:31.710
Hurry.

29:35.750 --> 29:37.010
All units, attention.

29:37.030 --> 29:37.880
This is very likely

29:37.880 --> 29:39.340
the location for the deal.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.000
Bowen.

29:47.640 --> 29:48.550
It won't fit.

29:49.590 --> 29:50.240
Useless.

29:53.480 --> 29:55.280
Lang Bowen got out of the car too.

29:56.550 --> 29:57.270
Take that out,

29:57.270 --> 29:58.470
and it'll fit, right?

30:04.960 --> 30:05.640
The money is in the trash can

30:05.640 --> 30:06.500
you mentioned.

30:06.830 --> 30:07.640
Where's the phone?

30:07.640 --> 30:08.680
I'm watching you.

30:09.030 --> 30:10.240
Take the case out.

30:10.750 --> 30:11.550
Put it in the trash can

30:11.550 --> 30:12.790
at the entrance of Dahua Alley

30:12.790 --> 30:13.590
in 10 minutes.

30:14.030 --> 30:15.430
You only have 10 minutes.

30:17.110 --> 30:17.590
Hello?

30:19.480 --> 30:20.480
Take the case out.

30:22.690 --> 30:23.860
Hurry up.

30:25.310 --> 30:26.570
All units, attention.

30:26.640 --> 30:28.700
This is not the location for the deal.

30:43.550 --> 30:44.350
They're here.

30:45.640 --> 30:46.100
I'll go.

30:46.270 --> 30:46.750
Wait.

31:01.440 --> 31:01.920
Hello?

31:02.070 --> 31:03.400
In 20 minutes,

31:03.480 --> 31:04.510
put it in the trash can at the entrance

31:04.510 --> 31:05.590
of Huining Park.

31:07.270 --> 31:07.750
Hello?

31:10.510 --> 31:12.240
He's obsessed with trash cans.

31:12.750 --> 31:13.750
Take the case out!

31:14.030 --> 31:14.830
Get in the car!

31:15.400 --> 31:15.970
Hurry!

31:16.350 --> 31:17.110
Get in the car.

31:17.110 --> 31:17.480
Okay.

31:42.880 --> 31:44.830
Hello, Mr. Zhou.

31:44.960 --> 31:45.640
Mr. Zhu.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.200
What's going on now?

31:48.270 --> 31:49.670
It's quite hot in the car.

31:49.790 --> 31:51.490
You should have seen the money.

31:51.490 --> 31:52.880
Can I take a look at

31:52.880 --> 31:53.770
the bianzhong now?

31:53.770 --> 31:55.830
The bianzhong is on the second floor.

31:55.880 --> 31:57.510
It's not convenient
to move it back and forth.

31:57.510 --> 31:58.920
How about, Mr. Zhou,

31:59.000 --> 32:01.000
you come up and take a look yourself?

32:01.170 --> 32:02.270
No way.

32:03.160 --> 32:04.310
I am in the light and you are in the dark.

32:04.310 --> 32:05.370
You want me to go up?

32:05.920 --> 32:07.100
I am not a child.

32:09.920 --> 32:11.440
Mr. Zhou, you are overthinking.

32:11.440 --> 32:14.300
It really is inconvenient
to move it back and forth.

32:15.510 --> 32:17.040
Then you have no sincerity.

32:34.070 --> 32:34.550
Uncle.

32:35.510 --> 32:36.000
I'll go.

32:54.000 --> 32:54.750
Mr. Zhou!

32:55.720 --> 32:56.510
Come down!

32:57.200 --> 32:58.200
I'll take you up!

33:21.200 --> 33:21.920
Mr. Zhou?

33:50.790 --> 33:51.400
Bro.

34:13.820 --> 34:14.840
[Police]

34:18.739 --> 34:20.100
[Police]

34:29.320 --> 34:30.179
Get out! Quick!

34:33.110 --> 34:33.770
Stop!

34:35.800 --> 34:36.800
Stop!

34:46.710 --> 34:47.440
Put your hands up!

34:47.440 --> 34:47.980
Hurry up!

34:55.880 --> 34:56.940
Where is Zhou Rong?

34:57.920 --> 34:59.070
Speak. Where is Zhou Rong?

34:59.070 --> 34:59.800
I don't know!

35:01.670 --> 35:02.810
Zhu Yifei is inside.

35:02.920 --> 35:03.630
Cuff them!

35:03.840 --> 35:04.440
Cuff them!

35:05.170 --> 35:06.150
Don't move when you get off later.

35:06.150 --> 35:06.800
Don't move!

35:06.800 --> 35:07.310
Get off!

35:09.070 --> 35:09.570
Go!

35:10.070 --> 35:10.770
Don't move!

35:11.400 --> 35:12.060
Don't move!

35:12.280 --> 35:13.280
Behave yourself.

35:23.650 --> 35:24.720
♪ He is ♪

35:26.300 --> 35:28.670
♪ Too cunning but like a joke ♪

35:30.090 --> 35:31.190
♪ Ha ha ha ♪

35:32.660 --> 35:33.870
♪ He ♪

35:35.340 --> 35:37.780
♪ Wears his glamorous nails ♪

35:51.000 --> 35:51.960
Let's split up for the search.

35:51.960 --> 35:52.440
Okay

35:54.000 --> 35:55.200
♪ Oh, he ♪

35:56.890 --> 36:01.010
♪ A rusted flower etched
across his chest ♪

36:03.080 --> 36:03.970
♪ Oh, he ♪

36:05.930 --> 36:09.080
♪ Says your worldview's still too small ♪

36:13.010 --> 36:16.710
♪ A rat that steals rice—
humans call it cunning ♪

36:17.610 --> 36:21.380
♪ A human who steals honey—
calls the bees hardworking ♪

36:22.000 --> 36:22.510
No.

36:22.180 --> 36:26.130
♪ Absurd, greedy—
self-proclaimed superior beings ♪

36:26.690 --> 36:31.240
♪ Hypocritical, wasteful, hollow—
this gaudy human race ♪

36:30.070 --> 36:30.960
My car!

36:31.110 --> 36:32.040
My car!

36:32.430 --> 36:33.550
Stop!

36:33.590 --> 36:34.400
What's going on?

36:34.400 --> 36:36.190
Someone drove my car away!

36:34.700 --> 36:35.740
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

36:37.230 --> 36:38.990
There's no brake!

36:39.270 --> 36:40.300
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

36:40.230 --> 36:41.230
Stop right there!

36:43.570 --> 36:44.730
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

37:02.070 --> 37:03.140
♪ He is ♪

37:04.730 --> 37:07.380
♪ Too cunning but like a joke ♪

37:08.510 --> 37:09.950
♪ Ha ha ha ♪

37:11.450 --> 37:12.610
♪ He ♪

37:13.760 --> 37:16.480
♪ Wears his glamorous nails ♪

37:29.480 --> 37:30.590
He's dead for sure.

37:44.190 --> 37:44.670
Hello?

37:45.480 --> 37:46.880
I'm at the park entrance.

37:47.110 --> 37:48.770
Put the money in the trash can.

37:49.590 --> 37:50.320
Which one?

37:50.670 --> 37:51.420
Are you blind?

37:51.420 --> 37:52.750
The one at the entrance.

37:52.960 --> 37:54.620
There are two at the entrance.

37:54.840 --> 37:55.670
The red one or the green one?

37:55.670 --> 37:56.470
The green one.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.370
Can you see me now?

38:03.400 --> 38:04.320
Yes, we can.

38:07.030 --> 38:08.630
Is it the one I'm pointing at?

38:08.670 --> 38:09.680
That's the one.

38:10.670 --> 38:12.850
Do you want the darn money or not?

38:12.960 --> 38:15.160
Why are you making me go round and round!

38:15.590 --> 38:16.850
He's quite ticked off.

38:17.970 --> 38:19.020
I have a card

38:19.050 --> 38:20.420
with 5 million for you.

38:20.550 --> 38:22.900
Take the money and get out of Sanjiangkou.

38:24.670 --> 38:25.190
Hello?

38:27.480 --> 38:28.030
Hello?

38:29.150 --> 38:29.760
He hung up?

38:30.590 --> 38:31.480
Bad guys nowadays

38:31.480 --> 38:33.360
are so impolite.

38:35.020 --> 38:35.590
Get off.

38:38.460 --> 38:39.390
What is he doing?

38:40.590 --> 38:41.510
Thinking of leaving again?

38:41.510 --> 38:42.510
All units, attention.

38:42.510 --> 38:43.910
Get ready to act any time.

38:44.800 --> 38:45.280
Go.

38:50.920 --> 38:51.680
Get off!

38:51.840 --> 38:52.540
Get off!

39:03.670 --> 39:04.730
Out for a breather?

39:04.800 --> 39:07.730
I'm going back to the hospital
to change my dressing.

39:07.880 --> 39:08.860
Wh-What did I do?

39:09.110 --> 39:09.680
Nothing.

39:09.960 --> 39:11.110
Take him back to the station
to change his dressing.

39:11.110 --> 39:11.640
Yes, sir.

39:11.670 --> 39:12.400
Chief Zhang?

39:12.670 --> 39:13.000
Chief Zhang!

39:13.000 --> 39:13.800
Get off.

39:14.400 --> 39:14.710
Wang,

39:14.710 --> 39:16.030
what's the situation on your side?

39:16.030 --> 39:17.590
We caught Hu Jianren and Lu Yibo.

39:17.590 --> 39:19.230
The seller of the bianzhong is Zhu Yifei.

39:19.230 --> 39:19.920
When he was trying to escape,

39:19.920 --> 39:21.850
he fell down the mountain and died.

39:22.110 --> 39:23.190
What about Zhou Rong?

39:23.190 --> 39:24.440
Zhou Rong didn't come at all.

39:24.440 --> 39:26.370
He probably went back to his villa.

39:27.800 --> 39:29.220
We fell for a decoy.

39:29.630 --> 39:30.510
The deal is very likely

39:30.510 --> 39:31.360
taking place at Zhou Rong's villa.

39:31.360 --> 39:32.710
Head to Zhou Rong's villa right away.

39:32.710 --> 39:33.440
Chief Zhang!

39:33.510 --> 39:34.240
Chief Zhang!

39:34.480 --> 39:36.080
You can't treat me like this!

39:36.230 --> 39:37.510
You can't treat me like this,

39:37.510 --> 39:37.960
Chief Zhang.

39:37.960 --> 39:38.920
I just got discharged from the hospital.

39:38.920 --> 39:40.440
How should I treat you, then?

39:40.440 --> 39:41.170
Chief Zhang!

39:50.400 --> 39:51.000
Captain Wang.

39:51.000 --> 39:52.060
Huo Zheng got away.

39:52.960 --> 39:53.760
Didn't he die?

39:53.880 --> 39:54.680
He didn't die.

39:57.550 --> 39:58.280
Chief Zhang.

39:58.760 --> 39:59.760
Huo Zheng is not dead.

39:59.760 --> 40:00.420
He got away.

40:01.150 --> 40:02.280
Arrange a search first,

40:02.280 --> 40:03.940
and then come over right away.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.040
Copy that.

40:06.070 --> 40:06.930
Take them away.

40:08.710 --> 40:09.110
Get up!

40:09.800 --> 40:10.150
Go!

40:10.170 --> 40:10.670
Go!

40:11.110 --> 40:11.550
Move!

40:19.110 --> 40:19.590
Bro.

40:20.440 --> 40:21.370
Do we make a move?

40:33.590 --> 40:35.120
Let's wait a little longer.

40:37.590 --> 40:38.120
Mr. Zhou.

40:48.710 --> 40:49.910
Where did you find it?

40:50.440 --> 40:51.790
In a small alley

40:51.880 --> 40:53.280
not far from the company.

40:53.280 --> 40:54.880
I found it on my way to work just now.

40:54.880 --> 40:55.760
The car wasn't locked

40:55.760 --> 40:57.110
and the keys were still in the ignition,

40:57.110 --> 40:58.110
so I drove it back.

40:59.400 --> 41:01.400
You didn't sleep all night, did you?

41:02.110 --> 41:03.510
This car has a GPS tracker.

41:03.510 --> 41:05.230
It hasn't stopped since yesterday.

41:05.230 --> 41:07.190
It almost drove out of Sanjiangkou.

41:07.190 --> 41:08.960
So how did you find it

41:08.960 --> 41:09.890
in a small alley?

41:19.400 --> 41:21.510
You've been undercover
next to me for so many years.

41:21.510 --> 41:23.040
I didn't expect it to be you.

41:24.020 --> 41:24.840
Wait.

41:26.480 --> 41:27.320
Don't do it here.
